      "description": "The Midwife’s Journal is designed for student, newly qualified and experienced midwives who want one organised place to record and reflect on their professional journey.\n\nTrack births, clinical skills, continuity of care experiences, reflections, placements and professional milestones while keeping your information stored locally on your device.\n\nFeatures include:\n• Birth logging and progress tracking\n• Primary birth keepsake board\n• Clinical skills and procedure tracking\n• Continuity of Care experience tracking\n• Guided professional reflections\n• Clinical calendar and shift planning\n• Obstetric date and gestation calculator\n• Progress reports and visual analytics\n• Achievement milestones\n• CSV and data export options\n• Local device storage with no cloud account required\n\nThe Midwife’s Journal is built to help you Record • Reflect • Grow throughout your midwifery journey.\n\nPlease do not enter patient names or other identifiable patient information.",
